  "tool.helixleft.help": "The same gesture as Helix (centre, radius, right-hand) — an existing point is shared, empty space places a new one — turning the other way as it rises — a left-hand thread, a left-hand spring. Handedness is which tool you used, so it is what the file records and it never changes by itself; a negative pitch is refused, because a coil that descends while it turns right is this one.",
